> 
> This patch add device tree binding documentation for CM36651 proximity/ light sensor.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Beomho Seo <beomho.seo@samsung.com>
> ---
>  .../devicetree/bindings/iio/light/cm36651.txt      |   25 ++++++++++++++++++++
